issues/588","id":700026707,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDcwMDAyNjcwNw==","user":{"login":"BorisBoutillier","id":18518188,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTE4MTg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18518188?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BorisBoutillier","html_url":"https://github.com/BorisBoutillier","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BorisBoutillier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BorisBoutillier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BorisBoutillier/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BorisBoutillier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BorisBoutillier/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BorisBoutillier/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BorisBoutillier/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BorisBoutillier/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BorisBoutillier/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-09-28T14:01:17Z","updated_at":"2020-09-28T14:01:17Z","body":"The texture you are loading must be added to the materials assets in the same way your are doing with the Color, or like the sprite.rs example is doing.\r\nI have removed the panic with the modification of the following code : \r\n```rust\r\nfn setup(\r\n    mut commands: Commands,\r\n    selection_materials: Res<SelectionMaterials>,\r\n    asset_server: Res<AssetServer>,\r\n    mut materials: ResMut<Assets<ColorMaterial>>,   // NEW\r\n) {\r\n    \r\n    commands.insert_resource(UiStateMaterials {\r\n        idle: materials.add(asset_server.load(\"assets/textures/idle.png\").unwrap().into()),  // UPDATED\r\n        moving: materials.add(asset_server.load(\"assets/textures/move.png\").unwrap().into()),  // UPDATED\r\n        moving_fast: materials.add(asset_server.load(\"assets/textures/move_fast.png\").unwrap().into()), // UPDATED\r\n    });\r\n   .....\r\n```\r\n\r\nError handling is currently almost non-existent in bevy, and is not yet the main priority.\r\n\r\nLet us know if this answer helped you move forward.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/comments/700026707/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"BorisBoutillier","id":18518188,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTE4MTg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18518188?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BorisBoutillier","html_url":"https://github.com/BorisBoutillier","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BorisBoutillier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BorisBoutillier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BorisBoutillier/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BorisBoutillier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BorisBoutillier/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BorisBoutillier/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BorisBoutillier/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BorisBoutillier/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BorisBoutillier/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/comments/701686393","html_url":"https://github.com/bevyengine/bevy/issues/588#issuecomment-701686393","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/588","id":701686393,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDcwMTY4NjM5Mw==","user":{"login":"jmrgibson","id":7917747,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MTc3NDc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7917747?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmrgibson","html_url":"https://github.com/jmrgibson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmrgibson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmrgibson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmrgibson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmrgibson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmrgibson/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmrgibson/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmrgibson/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmrgibson/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmrgibson/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-09-30T22:47:13Z","updated_at":"2020-09-30T22:47:13Z","body":"Yup, that fixes things, thanks. Are you looking for people to help with error handling? I'm pretty familiar with rust and have become spoiled by the compilers good error messages and have gotten into a \"if-it-compiles-it-works\" mentality, but I understand if there is not much point focusing on this area if everything is still in a state of flux.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/comments/701686393/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"jmrgibson","id":7917747,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MTc3NDc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7917747?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmrgibson","html_url":"https://github.com/jmrgibson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmrgibson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmrgibson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmrgibson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmrgibson/star